# <your-skill-name> skill

Wraps the [<upstream-r-package-name>](https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>) R package.

## Prerequisites

- R available on `PATH`.
- `install.packages("<upstream-r-package-name>")`.

## Usage from a shell

```bash
echo '<your minimal JSON payload>' | Rscript --vanilla skills/<your-skill-name>/invoke.R
```

## Usage from Python

```python
from bridges import invoke
result = invoke("<your-skill-name>", {"fn": "<function_name_1>", ...})
```

